{"id":"n63656-1-10","stage":3,"title":"성별 · 性别","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63656-1-10-1","ko":"당연히 여자는 분홍색, 남자는 파랑색이지.","zh":"当然了，女生用粉色，男生用蓝色啦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"당연히","meaning":"当然","explanation":"당연히：当然","readings":[{"term":"당연히","audio":"/audio/0efb3081ed85ab147e84.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49497","senseId":"1","lemma":"당연히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"당연히","audio":"/audio/0efb3081ed85ab147e84.mp3"}},{"text":"여자는","meaning":"女子，女人","explanation":"여자：女子，女人；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"여자","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27369","senseId":"1","lemma":"여자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여자는","audio":"/audio/a356b569613a3a24fc74.mp3"}},{"text":"분홍색,","meaning":"粉红色，粉红","explanation":"분홍색：粉红色，粉红","readings":[{"term":"분홍색","audio":"/audio/cdd43df3585ad93fdc57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"21130","senseId":"1","lemma":"분홍색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"분홍색","audio":"/audio/cdd43df3585ad93fdc57.mp3"}},{"text":"남자는","meaning":"男子，男人","explanation":"남자：男子，男人；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60865","senseId":"1","lemma":"남자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남자는","audio":"/audio/40ebb09428b30870bfab.mp3"}},{"text":"파랑색이지.","meaning":"蓝；色","explanation":"파랑：蓝；색：色；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"파랑","audio":"/audio/5751d675c232e47a836a.mp3"},{"term":"색","audio":"/audio/4e0f2a64814ac0cdc90a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82252","senseId":"1","lemma":"파랑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"20231","senseId":"4","lemma":"색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"파랑색이지","audio":"/audio/873130357db1bcffd0a0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"0efb3081ed85ab14","term":"당연히","zh":"当然","audio":"/audio/0efb3081ed85ab147e84.mp3","entryId":"49497","definition":"按道理应当是那样。","pronunciation":["당연히"]},{"id":"3109db6ce062c863","term":"여자","zh":"女子，女人","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3","entryId":"27369","definition":"作为女性出生的人。","pronunciation":["여자"]},{"id":"cdd43df3585ad93f","term":"분홍색","zh":"粉红色，粉红","audio":"/audio/cdd43df3585ad93fdc57.mp3","entryId":"21130","definition":"白色与红色混合而成的颜色。","pronunciation":["분ː홍색"]},{"id":"c6a3b6d97217b4d8","term":"남자","zh":"男子，男人","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3","entryId":"60865","definition":"作为男性出生的人。","pronunciation":["남자"]},{"id":"5751d675c232e47a","term":"파랑","zh":"蓝","audio":"/audio/5751d675c232e47a836a.mp3","entryId":"82252","definition":"蓝颜色或蓝色染料。","pronunciation":["파랑"]},{"id":"4e0f2a64814ac0cd","term":"색","zh":"色","audio":"/audio/4e0f2a64814ac0cdc90a.mp3","entryId":"20231","definition":"表示“颜色”。","pronunciation":["색"]}],"audio":"/audio/e182e075af6d9db5f82b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63656-1-10-2","ko":"성별로 색을 나누는 것은 너무 뒤떨어진 생각이야.","zh":"按性别区分颜色这种想法太落后了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"성별로","meaning":"性别","explanation":"성별：性别；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"성별","audio":"/audio/b6eec4943f7543e84b6c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63656","senseId":"1","lemma":"성별","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"성별로","audio":"/audio/e573e176c54f4047811a.mp3"}},{"text":"색을","meaning":"色，色彩","explanation":"색：色，色彩；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"색","audio":"/audio/4e0f2a64814ac0cdc90a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20231","senseId":"1","lemma":"색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"색을","audio":"/audio/184eccbbdcf346a6008d.mp3"}},{"text":"나누는","meaning":"分类，区分","explanation":"나누다：分类，区分；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"나누다","audio":"/audio/8a88d2ae9895b06ef350.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29749","senseId":"2","lemma":"나누다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나누는","audio":"/audio/645b535baaf426971834.mp3"}},{"text":"것은","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것은","audio":"/audio/66faf3bab33879865298.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"뒤떨어진","meaning":"跟不上","explanation":"뒤떨어지다：跟不上；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"뒤떨어지다","audio":"/audio/9af39ff41d14837af3a3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58028","senseId":"3","lemma":"뒤떨어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뒤떨어진","audio":"/audio/2dba482093b1f332f060.mp3"}},{"text":"생각이야.","meaning":"想法，念头，心思","explanation":"생각：想法，念头，心思；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"5","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각이야","audio":"/audio/7e27300366f140fc7c3a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b6eec4943f7543e8","term":"성별","zh":"性别","audio":"/audio/b6eec4943f7543e84b6c.mp3","entryId":"63656","definition":"男和女；或指雄性和雌性的区别。","pronunciation":["성ː별"]},{"id":"4e0f2a64814ac0cd","term":"색","zh":"色，色彩","audio":"/audio/4e0f2a64814ac0cdc90a.mp3","entryId":"20231","definition":"物体吸收光后表现出的明暗或红、黄、蓝等颜色。","pronunciation":["색"]},{"id":"8a88d2ae9895b06e","term":"나누다","zh":"分类，区分","audio":"/audio/8a88d2ae9895b06ef350.mp3","entryId":"29749","definition":"根据某种标准把多个掺杂在一起的东西分化或归类为两个以上的种类。","pronunciation":["나누다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"9af39ff41d14837a","term":"뒤떨어지다","zh":"跟不上","audio":"/audio/9af39ff41d14837af3a3.mp3","entryId":"58028","definition":"不符合时代社会的潮流或流行趋势，落伍。","pronunciation":["뒤ː떠러지다"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"想法，念头，心思","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"对某事持有意见或感受。","pronunciation":["생각"]}],"audio":"/audio/abc06a7229d63afd17b2.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.873,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=63656","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":103,"sequenceScore":2.6997,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["按性别区分颜色这种想法太落后了。","当然了，女生用粉色，男生用蓝色啦。","你用面粉熬浆糊，打算做什么？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["当然了，女生用粉色，男生用蓝色啦。","你用面粉熬浆糊，打算做什么？","按性别区分颜色这种想法太落后了。"],"answer":2}]}
